                            "The 1,200 MW at Comanche Peak nuclear plant still has no long-term data-center buyer.",
                            "Q-Generation Holdings registered up to 5M VST shares for resale, and its lock-up ends on 30 Jan 2027.",
                            "Price is below the EMA 50, 100 and 200, and the 7.17% drop on 20 Nov came on volume 26% above average."
